[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0010","text":"——诶……\n要拍……甜花的……照片……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0020","text":"嗯\n甘奈拜托我拍的——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0030","text":"抱歉，你不想拍吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0040","text":"那，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0050","text":"这套衣服……\n肚子……露出来了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0060","text":"因为很害羞……\n……不要……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0070","text":"……这样啊，我知道了\n我会跟甘奈说一声的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0080","text":"嗯、嗯……\n对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0090","text":"…………啊，不过——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_03_0100","text":"如果是和天使的小菜……一起的话……\n拍照……也可以……？"}]
